# The package that declares an interface also dispatches on it, while the
# implementation lives in the consumer. Codegen builds the dispatch closure's
# sig from the call site (arity + return type), and nothing in this package
# names that shape: an `InterfaceRef` walk sees type arguments only, and a
# `void` return contributes no type at all.
# name       dir   deps       root
@test/lib    lib   -
main         app   @test/lib  root
